<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He gives support and comforts you,</l><l>Interceding night and day.</l><l>And when you’re weak He groans for you</l><l>With words you cannot say.</l><l>He’s the Spirit, interceding.</l><l>He’s the Spirit. Don’t neglect this</l><l>Wonderful One,</l><l>Who is praying for you.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So many times we are so weak,</l><l>But Someone deep within</l><l>Supplies the very help we need,</l><l>And we’re upheld by Him.</l><l>He says, “Don’t be disappointed.”</l><l>He knows all your fears and failures;</l><l>He’s praying for you</l><l>As no one else can do.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
